```
     1→import { test, expect } from '../fixtures/test-base';
     2→
     3→/**
     4→ * Dashboard Overview E2E Tests
     5→ *
     6→ * Tests for the dashboard home view — "what's happening right now?"
     7→ *
     8→ * Covered ACs:
     9→ * - AC: @ui-dashboard-overview ac-1 — Active work, status summary, needs-attention aggregation
    10→ *
    11→ * Legacy ACs preserved:
    12→ * - AC: @web-dashboard ac-1, ac-3, ac-20
    13→ *
    14→ * Strategy: The built web UI hardcodes DAEMON_API_BASE to localhost:3456, but E2E
    15→ * daemons run on ephemeral ports. Data-dependent tests use page.route() to intercept
    16→ * browser-side API calls and fulfill with fixture-consistent data, validating the
    17→ * full UI aggregation path (fetch → compute → render).
    18→ */
    19→
    20→// --- Mock data matching E2E fixture expectations ---
    21→
    22→/** Task data matching packages/web-ui/tests/fixtures/project.tasks.yaml */
    23→function fixtureTasks() {
    24→	return {
    25→		items: [
    26→			{
